ilt around an animation of the roughly 10,000 galaxies in the Hubble Ultra Deep Field, placed at their measured redshift distances. It gives a brief history of deep field images and ends with a 3D fly-through.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a way to grasp the scale of the universe and what the Hubble deep field image means.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"cosmic scale\",\"categories\":[\"Cosmology & astrophysics\",\"Data visualization & information design\"],\"tags\":[\"hubble\",\"deep field\",\"galaxies\",\"astronomy\",\"visualization\"],\"quote\":\"This [0] IMHO gives more perspective\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"oFtjKbXKqbg\",\"title\":\"Pieter Levels: Programming, Viral AI Startups, and Digital Nomad Life | Lex Fridman Podcast #440\",\"channel\":\"Lex Fridman\",\"summary\":\"A roughly 3.7-hour Lex Fridman podcast with Pieter Levels, the solo developer behind over 40 startups. They discuss programming, viral AI products, indie hacking and digital nomad life.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended in solo-developer threads for its insights on shipping small projects with simple stacks and AI tools.\",\"content_type\":\"podcast\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"indie hacking\",\"categories\":[\"Startups & entrepreneurship\",\"Tech pioneers & interviews\",\"Software practice, open source & careers\"],\"tags\":[\"pieter levels\",\"solo developer\",\"startups\",\"digital nomad\",\"php\"],\"quote\":\"I highly recommend checking out this podcast\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.5},{\"vid\":\"oGTQ0Wj6yIg\",\"title\":\"Joe Rogan Experience #1419 - Daryl Davis\",\"channel\":\"PowerfulJRE\",\"summary\":\"Joe Rogan interviews Daryl Davis, a Black blues musician who has befriended Ku Klux Klan members and helped many leave the group. He tells stories of how he talked with them.\",\"why_hn\":\"Offered as a persuasion success story in threads about polarization and online toxicity.\",\"content_type\":\"podcast\",\"level\