ive ability.\",\"why_hn\":\"Pointed to as a well-cited hour on IQ and genetics whenever intelligence and heritability come up.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"genetics of intelligence\",\"categories\":[\"Evolution & genetics\",\"Psychology & human behavior\"],\"tags\":[\"iq\",\"heritability\",\"gwas\",\"genomics\",\"steve hsu\"],\"quote\":\"You can also choose to spend an hour on this talk by Stephen Hsu who does research on IQ and genetics\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"63vqob-MljQ\",\"title\":\"Kylie Minogue - Come Into My World (Official Video) [Full HD Remastered]\",\"channel\":\"Kylie Minogue\",\"summary\":\"The official music video for Kylie Minogue's Come Into My World, directed by Michel Gondry, built around a looping scene with multiplying copies of Kylie.\",\"why_hn\":\"Cited as a landmark looping music video, a reference point for creative video and editing tricks.\",\"content_type\":\"music\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"looping music video\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\",\"Animation & visual effects\"],\"tags\":[\"michel gondry\",\"kylie minogue\",\"music video\",\"loop\",\"visual effects\"],\"quote\":\"One of the best music videos, in my opinion.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"64cEmjtwRgw\",\"title\":\"Cody's Algae Panel\",\"channel\":\"Cody'sLab\",\"summary\":\"Cody's Lab builds a prototype algae growing panel as an experiment before making more. The channel also shows growing algae for consumption.\",\"why_hn\":\"Pointed to as a cheap, hands-on example of home algae cultivation.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"algae cultivation\",\"categories\":[\"Biology & biotechnology\",\"Environment, agriculture & food systems\",\"Home, DIY & practical skills\"],\"tags\":[\"algae\",\"diy\",\"bioreactor\",\"home experiments\",\"food production\"],\"quote\":\"Cody'sLab has a few videos about growing his own algae for consumptio