ws\",\"Startups & entrepreneurship\"],\"tags\":[\"elon musk\",\"spacex\",\"tesla\",\"startups\",\"motivation\"],\"quote\":\"His answer on motivation was striking to me\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"6Maq5IyHSuc\",\"title\":\"A simple guide to electronic components.\",\"channel\":\"bigclivedotcom\",\"summary\":\"Big Clive gives a 38-minute beginner's guide to identifying common electronic components and what they do. He keeps the maths minimal and aims to fill gaps for people just starting out.\",\"why_hn\":\"Suggested as a gentle starting point for beginners in electronics.\",\"content_type\":\"tutorial\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"electronic components\",\"categories\":[\"Electronics & circuit design\",\"Embedded systems & DIY electronics\"],\"tags\":[\"electronics\",\"beginners\",\"components\",\"identification\",\"hobby\"],\"quote\":\"And then some bigclivedotcom to get going\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"6Nfqpr3ygSg\",\"title\":\"Death Magnetic Retail vs Guitar Hero 3\",\"channel\":\"Metalfan7577\",\"summary\":\"A short comparison of the retail release of Metallica's Death Magnetic against the Guitar Hero 3 version of the same song. It switches between the two so you can hear and see the heavy clipping in the retail master.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN uses it as the go-to demonstration of the loudness war and what over-compressed mastering does to music.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"loudness war\",\"categories\":[\"Audio & video engineering\",\"Music performance & songs\"],\"tags\":[\"audio mastering\",\"dynamic range\",\"clipping\",\"metallica\",\"brickwalling\"],\"quote\":\"A comparison between these two versions was the eye opener for me.\",\"recommenders\":1,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"6NlI4No3s0M\",\"title\":\"Just Intonation vs Equal Temperament\",\"channel\":\"Trippin' on Cookies\",\"summary\":\"A short demonstration comparing just intonation with equal temperament, played so you c