eral\",\"primary_topic\":\"apollo saturn v launch\",\"categories\":[\"Space exploration & spaceflight\",\"Filmmaking & video production\"],\"tags\":[\"apollo 11\",\"saturn v\",\"high speed film\",\"rocket launch\",\"f-1 engines\"],\"quote\":\"It explains the sequence of events over the course of 8+ minutes (30 seconds real time).\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"DSjbTC-hvqQ\",\"title\":\"\\\"Code is the Easy Part\\\" by Evan Czaplicki\",\"channel\":\"elm-conf\",\"summary\":\"Evan Czaplicki, creator of Elm, gives an elm-conf 2016 talk on the non-code side of building a language. It covers the philosophy behind Elm's development approach, including batching work and the priorities of different language communities.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN points people to it to understand Elm's design philosophy, such as favoring simplicity over type classes, when they question its choices.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"elm language design\",\"categories\":[\"Programming language design\",\"Functional programming\",\"Software practice, open source & careers\"],\"tags\":[\"elm\",\"evan czaplicki\",\"language design\",\"open source community\",\"elm-conf\"],\"quote\":\"great talk by Evan Czaplicki and his approach to Elm development\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"DUGGJpn2_zY\",\"title\":\"27c3: Console Hacking 2010 (en)\",\"channel\":\"Christiaan008\",\"summary\":\"The fail0verflow team (bushing, marcan, sven) present console hacking at 27C3, covering Wii, Xbox 360 and PS3 exploits. They explain how the PS3 was cracked after Sony removed Other OS.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as the primary source on Sony's ECDSA nonce-reuse blunder and the history of console cracking.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"game console hacking\",\"categories\":[\"Speedrunning, glitches & game hacking\",\"Security & hacking\",\"Cryptography\"],\"tags\":[\"ps3\",\"ecdsa\",\"fail0verflow\",\"wii\",\