ghtning payment channels work.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"lightning network\",\"categories\":[\"Cryptography\",\"Distributed systems\"],\"tags\":[\"lightning network\",\"bitcoin\",\"litecoin\",\"segwit\",\"payment channels\"],\"quote\":\"This video gives a high-level overview\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"MtxA20Q-Uss\",\"title\":\"Building Prototypes Dan Gelbart  part 18 of 18  Design\",\"channel\":\"Dan Gelbart\",\"summary\":\"The final part of Dan Gelbart's 18-part Building Prototypes series, focused on mechanical design. It opens with a demonstration of stiffness and covers practical design principles for prototype machines.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it, and the whole series, for practical mechanical design insight such as how structures achieve stiffness.\",\"content_type\":\"lecture\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"mechanical design\",\"categories\":[\"Mechanical & precision engineering\",\"3D printing, CNC & maker projects\"],\"tags\":[\"prototyping\",\"stiffness\",\"machine design\",\"engineering\",\"gelbart\"],\"quote\":\"He starts off with a \$10 piece of aluminum that took maybe an hour or two to make\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"Mx-AllVZ1VY\",\"title\":\"Keynote: Flutter (Dart Developer Summit 2016)\",\"channel\":\"Google for Developers\",\"summary\":\"Keynote from the 2016 Dart Developer Summit introducing Flutter, Google's toolkit for building mobile apps from one codebase. It shows early demos aimed at native look and feel.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as the early introduction to Flutter's single-codebase iOS and Android approach.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"flutter mobile framework\",\"categories\":[\"Software architecture & design\",\"Web development\"],\"tags\":[\"flutter\",\"dart\",\"cross-platform\",\"mobile development\",\"keynote\"],\"quote\":\"I'm looking into Flutter/Dart from Google for building iOS/Androi