er of her own songs.\",\"content_type\":\"music\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"lady gaga early performance\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\"],\"tags\":[\"lady gaga\",\"nyu\",\"live performance\",\"songwriting\",\"pre-fame\"],\"quote\":\"she is also a phenomenal musician. Here's a video from before she was famous\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"NPOHf20slZg\",\"title\":\"\$30,000,000 AI Is Hiding a Scam\",\"channel\":\"Coffeezilla\",\"summary\":\"Coffeezilla investigates the company behind the Rabbit R1 AI gadget, alleging a shady history as a crypto and NFT startup and questioning its large action model claims.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN threads on the Rabbit R1 point to it as an exposé on the company's history and operation.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"rabbit r1 scam investigation\",\"categories\":[\"Media, journalism & propaganda\",\"Consumer devices & gadgets\",\"LLMs & generative AI\"],\"tags\":[\"rabbit r1\",\"coffeezilla\",\"ai hardware\",\"investigation\",\"large action model\"],\"quote\":\"It's a bit clickbaity, but turns out Rabbit was a crypto-nft-ai buzzword company with a very shady history.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"NST3u-GjjFw\",\"title\":\"ChatOps at GitHub - Jesse Newland\",\"channel\":\"Rubyfuza\",\"summary\":\"Jesse Newland describes how GitHub uses Hubot, its chat bot, to run operations such as deployment, monitoring, graphing and provisioning from chat rooms. He explains how this improves shared awareness and remote work culture.\",\"why_hn\":\"The go-to reference for ChatOps, recommended for the idea of chat as a shared command line where teammates learn by watching.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"chatops\",\"categories\":[\"Cloud, DevOps & reliability\",\"Testing, debugging & developer tools\"],\"tags\":[\"chatops\",\"hubot\",\"github\",\"devops\",\"deployment\"],\"quote\":\"There's a pretty good talk 