\",\"categories\":[\"VR, AR & spatial computing\",\"Consumer devices & gadgets\"],\"tags\":[\"project starline\",\"3d video\",\"google\",\"remote work\",\"telepresence\"],\"quote\":\"No headset to wear. No disorientation. You just sit down and you're there with somebody else.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"Q8ccXzM3x8A\",\"title\":\"The Case for String Theory - Sixty Symbols\",\"channel\":\"Sixty Symbols\",\"summary\":\"Sixty Symbols interviews Nottingham cosmologist Tony Padilla, who says string theory deserves to be taken seriously. He explains how strings emerged from the equations rather than being invented.\",\"why_hn\":\"It is cited in string theory arguments as a counterweight to critics, a working physicist's reason to think there is something to the theory.\",\"content_type\":\"interview\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"string theory\",\"categories\":[\"Quantum physics\",\"Cosmology & astrophysics\"],\"tags\":[\"string theory\",\"tony padilla\",\"theoretical physics\",\"cosmology\",\"sixty symbols\"],\"quote\":\"a professor explains why he at least believes there is something to it\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"Q8oCilY4szc\",\"title\":\"Boeing: Last Week Tonight with John Oliver (HBO)\",\"channel\":\"LastWeekTonight\",\"summary\":\"John Oliver's Last Week Tonight segment on Boeing, tracing how it went from a quality engineering company to one tied to crashes and 'quality escapes'. It covers the 737 MAX failures and employee concerns about safety.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as an entertaining and thorough overview of Boeing's decline whenever the company's safety problems are in the news.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"boeing safety failures\",\"categories\":[\"Aviation & aerospace engineering\",\"Media, journalism & propaganda\",\"Tech industry & business models\"],\"tags\":[\"boeing\",\"737 max\",\"john oliver\",\"aviation safety\",\"corporate culture\"],\"quote\":