ine learning & deep learning\",\"Recreational & visual math\",\"History of computing\"],\"tags\":[\"menace\",\"reinforcement learning\",\"tic-tac-toe\",\"donald michie\",\"matt parker\",\"machine learning history\"],\"quote\":\"an amazing way to teach kids about this.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"RLySXTIBS3c\",\"title\":\"Orange Juice Trade - Trading Places\",\"channel\":\"wKw\",\"summary\":\"The climactic orange juice futures trading scene from the film Trading Places, in which the heroes corner the market on the trading floor.\",\"why_hn\":\"Cited as an accessible depiction of how commodity trading and the trading pit work.\",\"content_type\":\"comedy\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"commodities trading\",\"categories\":[\"Film & TV clips\",\"Investing & personal finance\"],\"tags\":[\"trading places\",\"futures\",\"trading pit\",\"film clip\"],\"quote\":\"This is still the best (Hollywood quality) depiction of what the trading pit looked like in reality.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"RcGyVTAoXEU\",\"title\":\"How to Make Stress Your Friend | Kelly McGonigal | TED\",\"channel\":\"TED\",\"summary\":\"Psychologist Kelly McGonigal argues in this TED talk that stress is harmful mainly if you believe it is, and that reaching out to others is an underrated way to reduce its effects.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN mentions it when discussing how believing stress is harmful affects health and anxiety.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"stress and health psychology\",\"categories\":[\"Psychology & human behavior\",\"Mental health & neurodiversity\"],\"tags\":[\"stress\",\"psychology\",\"ted\",\"mindset\",\"health\"],\"quote\":\"Anecdotally, I did feel less anxious than usual in the days after I first watched the video.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"RijGNytjbOI\",\"title\":\"DEF CON 26 CRYPTO AND PRIVACY VILLAGE - Scott Arciszewski - No Way JOSE! Designing Cryptography\",\"channel\":\"DEFCO