\":\"Rick Beato\",\"summary\":\"Rick Beato discusses a theory of why some children develop perfect pitch, based on early exposure to music. He draws on his experience with his own children.\",\"why_hn\":\"Pointed to in threads on training absolute pitch in children as a practitioner's account.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"perfect pitch\",\"categories\":[\"Music theory, synthesis & production\",\"Neuroscience & the brain\",\"Education & learning\"],\"tags\":[\"absolute pitch\",\"ear training\",\"music education\",\"child development\"],\"quote\":\"Rick Beato has some videos about how he trained his kids\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"Th4VlqQyVr4\",\"title\":\"Leaked: Pentagon's UFO -BUSTED!\",\"channel\":\"Thunderf00t\",\"summary\":\"Thunderf00t analyzes the leaked Pentagon UFO videos and offers mundane explanations for the fuzzy triangle and tic-tac footage.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters point to it as a skeptical debunking of the Pentagon UFO videos.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"ufo video debunking\",\"categories\":[\"Media, journalism & propaganda\",\"Religion, belief & skepticism\"],\"tags\":[\"ufo\",\"pentagon\",\"debunking\",\"thunderf00t\",\"skepticism\"],\"quote\":\"See this video by \\\"Thunderf00t\\\" which gives really good earthy reasons for what's been seen.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"ThjvMReOXYM\",\"title\":\"Crust of Rust: async/await\",\"channel\":\"Jon Gjengset\",\"summary\":\"Jon Gjengset's long live-coding Crust of Rust episode on async/await, focused on the mental model for using it rather than on Futures, Pin and Wakers internals. Topics include awaiting multiple futures, cancellation, executors and select.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a deep, practical dive for learning how Rust async works.\",\"content_type\":\"tutorial\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"rust async/await\",\"categories\":[\"C, C++, Rust, Go & systems languages\"],\"tags\":[\"rust\",\"async\",\"futures\",\"concurrency\",\"live coding\"],\"quote\":\"these two videos are also great deep dives into Rust async\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"TiXINuf5nbI\",\"title\":\"Jake Thackray 'Molly Metcalfe'\",\"channel\":\"TallPiler\",\"summary\":\"Jake Thackray performs the folk song Molly Metcalfe, which opens with an explanation of the traditional northern English sheep-counting system (yan, tan, tethera). It is a short, witty piece of British folk songwriting.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it in threads about sheep-counting systems as the famous song that explains them.\",\"content_type\":\"music\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"sheep-counting folk song\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\",\"Language & linguistics\"],\"tags\":[\"jake thackray\",\"yan tan tethera\",\"folk song\",\"counting systems\",\"british folk\"],\"quote\":\"I'll again recommend the Youtube video of Jake Thackray singing 'Molly Metcalfe'\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"TlinocVHpzk\",\"title\":\"Boeing 737 Stall Escape manoeuvre, why MAX needs MCAS!!\",\"channel\":\"Mentour Pilot\",\"summary\":\"Mentour Pilot, a 737 instructor, explains the approach-to-stall and escape manoeuvre and why the 737 MAX needs MCAS while the 737NG did not. He covers the jackscrew and pitch behavior in terms a general viewer can follow.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN people recommend it as an easy-to-understand pilot's explanation of the 737 MAX MCAS issue.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"737 max mcas\",\"categories\":[\"Aviation & aerospace engineering\"],\"tags\":[\"boeing 737 max\",\"mcas\",\"aviation\",\"stall recovery\",\"flight controls\"],\"quote\":\"It's not very technical, but very easy to understand.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"TrC6ROeV4GI\",\"title\":\"CppCon 2018:H. Wright “Large-Scale Changes at Google: Lessons Learned From 5 Yrs of Mass Migrations”\",