er problem-solving strategies\",\"categories\":[\"Python, Ruby & scripting languages\",\"Software practice, open source & careers\"],\"tags\":[\"python\",\"raymond hettinger\",\"cognitive load\",\"problem solving\",\"object-oriented design\"],\"quote\":\"Raymond Hettinger gave an entertaining talk [0] on a related topic.\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"UziFw-jQSks\",\"title\":\"The Dolphin House\",\"channel\":\"Atrocity Guide\",\"summary\":\"Atrocity Guide covers the 1965 dolphin experiments of Dr. John C. Lilly and Margaret Howe, who tried to teach dolphins English. It traces the bizarre methods and Lilly's later drug-fueled beliefs.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as a decent, entertaining summary of Lilly's life and work whenever dolphin communication research comes up.\",\"content_type\":\"documentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"john lilly dolphin experiments\",\"categories\":[\"Animals & nature\",\"Documentaries & storytelling\",\"Scientific method & science communication\"],\"tags\":[\"john c. lilly\",\"dolphins\",\"margaret howe\",\"animal communication\",\"science history\"],\"quote\":\"This video does a decent job of summarizing his life and work\",\"recommenders\":2,\"score\":2.0},{\"vid\":\"V2P8mjWRqpk\",\"title\":\"Hetzner shows Special AM5 Board with 90° Rotated Socket\",\"channel\":\"der8auer EN\",\"summary\":\"Der8auer tours Hetzner's test lab and shows a custom AM5 server motherboard with the CPU socket rotated 90 degrees, built for rack airflow in their AX52 servers.\",\"why_hn\":\"Pointed to as a look at Hetzner's unusual semi-custom server hardware and cooling.\",\"content_type\":\"demo\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"custom server motherboards\",\"categories\":[\"Computer architecture & CPUs\",\"Cloud, DevOps & reliability\",\"Hardware (other)\"],\"tags\":[\"hetzner\",\"am5\",\"server hardware\",\"cooling\",\"data center\"],\"quote\":\"The second is especially interesting as it demonstrates Hetzner'